The driver writes its entire result to stdout, which the run wrapper redirected
into raw-result.json. This file records that the stream was captured there and
is not lost: stdout and raw-result.json are the same bytes for this run.

  python3 experiments/EXP-SEMBIN-992e73/code/curve_table.py > raw-result.json

Verify with the sha256 of raw-result.json in artifact-digests.json.
